= Wrap-up

== What you can do now

- Read, write, and debug Deployment, Service, and Ingress manifests.
- Deploy a multi-service application to a real cluster and expose it.
- Package the whole thing with Helm.

The same `kubectl` / manifests / Helm work against *any* conformant cluster.

